hdef jotx safety

  title Safety analysis
  tags safety

  def heading "Safety analysis"

  def paragraph "A hazard analysis starts with the functions and how they can fail."

  def mermaid flow "From function to safety goal"
    src """flowchart LR
  F[Function] --> M[Malfunction]
  M --> H[Hazard]
  H --> G[Safety goal]"""

  def decision "Use HARA before FMEA"
    status accepted
    date 2026-10-01
    context FMEA needs the safety goals as input.
    decision Run the HARA first.
    consequences One more review step.

  def paragraph "Back to [requirements](requirements.jot)."
